<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico set to release 1997 monetary plan.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico set to release 1997 monetary plan.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico will release an advance version of its 1997 monetary policy plan on Wednesday at about 1645 local time (2245 GMT), an official at the central bank said.</p>
<p>A complete version of the program will be released next month.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559</p>
</text>
